factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 5 problems
  The draft gives the court hearing date as 27 நவம்பர் (27 November) in slides_spec and as 26 நவம்பர and 27 நவம்பர in the caption, but the article only says '27-ம் தேதி' without naming the month.
  The draft gives the encroachment removal date as 26 நவம்பர in the caption, but the article only says '26-ம் தேதி' without naming the month.
  The caption says the court hearing is 'இதற்கு முன்னதாக' (before this), and the reel_script says the removal is on the 26th and the hearing on the 27th; the article says the hearing is on the 27th, one day after the 26th removal, so the sequence is consistent, but the caption's wording 'இதற்கு முன்னதாக' reverses the article's 'இதற்கு ஒரு நாள் முன்னதாக' ordering relative to the hearing, which is a misstatement of the timeline.
  The reel_script omits the article's key point that the letter came from the founder and asks for the Central Zone IG to lead the security arrangement? (It is included.) However, the caption's claim that Radhakrishnan 'குற்றம் சாட்டியுள்ளார்' (accused) of people plotting riots is presented as a direct accusation without the article's framing that the letter says these people are 'சதித்திட்டம் தீட்டி வருவதாக தெரிகிறது' (it appears they are plotting), which overstates certainty.
  The reel_script says the petition was sent to the chief secretary and home secretary, but the article says the letter was addressed to them; this is consistent, yet the reel_script states the 'கலவரம் ஏற்படலாம் என அச்சம் எழுந்துள்ளது' as the cause of the request, which is a reasonable paraphrase, so no issue here beyond the above.
